00:56:06.090 --> 00:56:09.090
New Hanover County
Schools discipline

00:56:09.090 --> 00:56:12.720
reports and progress for
children in public schools

00:56:12.720 --> 00:56:13.740
in the county.

00:56:13.740 --> 00:56:16.680
That's in a separate lockdown
